<title>NETHERLANDS: PHILIPS SAYS Q3 &quot;MOST DISAPPOINTING&quot;.</title>
<headline>PHILIPS SAYS Q3 &quot;MOST DISAPPOINTING&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>EINDHOVEN, Netherlands 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philips Electronics NV said on Thursday its third quarter business performance was &quot;most disappointing&quot;.</p>
<p>&quot;The anticipated recovery of sales and income has not materialised,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The Dutch electronics giant earlier posted third quarter net profit from normal operations of 123 million guilders, down from 539 million a year earlier.</p>
</text>
